{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/app.bsky.feed.post/3m7k73ad7mk2p","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn","uri":"at://did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/app.bsky.feed.post/3m7k73ad7mk2p","cid":"bafyreiai5fhp53v5p5eapna6r2xvfuv6eu3nlq5t4mer3keaj5sszfx7zi","auteur_did":"did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/agenetet.bsky.social/post/3m7k73ad7mk2p","date":"2025-12-09T09:08:47.244Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-12-09T09:08:49.731Z","text":"Il y a 120 ans, la France adoptait la loi de 1905 : pilier de notre République.\n\nReconnaissance à celles et ceux qui font vivre la laïcité chaque jour, en particulier nos enseignants.\nÀ ceux qui la défient : aucune complaisance.\n\nLa laïcité, partout, toujours.","facets":[],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreigc6benfe3repyqjdknthvs7mgy7wkp7a7pngpj4lzqqzp63e4urm","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:z7ktudp4uqrdbj5yyw6vw4tn/bafkreigc6benfe3repyqjdknthvs7mgy7wkp7a7pngpj4lzqqzp63e4urm","alt":"","ar":{"height":1280,"width":976}}]},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:at://did:plc:aj7nw5dlhpmid2pe3o7jjw2z/app.bsky.feed.post/3m7iwrmmdxs2r","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:aj7nw5dlhpmid2pe3o7jjw2z","uri":"at://did:plc:aj7nw5dlhpmid2pe3o7jjw2z/app.bsky.feed.post/3m7iwrmmdxs2r","cid":"bafyreifz4h534ji7axn64tinwng5ivjananzunegwy5pmcon34outgkzou","auteur_did":"did:plc:aj7nw5dlhpmid2pe3o7jjw2z","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/mathildeollivier.bsky.social/post/3m7iwrmmdxs2r","date":"2025-12-08T21:07:34.908Z","type":"original","indexe":"2025-12-08T21:07:40.336Z","text":"🚨La droite et le gouvernement s’opposent au train de nuit Paris–Berlin–Vienne !\n\nMon amendement pour préserver cette ligne a été refusé par la droite.\n\n❌ Un échec pour le train de nuit, pour les Français·es de l’étranger et pour une mobilité durable en Europe.\n\nNous continuerons le combat.\n\n#PLF2026","facets":[{"features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#tag","tag":"PLF2026"}],"index":{"byteEnd":322,"byteStart":314}}],"author":null,"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:aj7nw5dlhpmid2pe3o7jjw2z/bafkreicoj6nmv6mks7jm6wtw4uadwnvcddn6bdofkmkbikvm3lpxc5s6pe","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:aj7nw5dlhpmid2pe3o7jjw2z/bafkreicoj6nmv6mks7jm6wtw4uadwnvcddn6bdofkmkbikvm3lpxc5s6pe","alt":"","ar":{"height":1281,"width":1920}}]},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:rp:did:plc:aj7nw5dlhpmid2pe3o7jjw2z:at://did:plc:fcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng/app.bsky.feed.post/3m7abd5xjdc2u","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:aj7nw5dlhpmid2pe3o7jjw2z","uri":"at://did:plc:fcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng/app.bsky.feed.post/3m7abd5xjdc2u","cid":"bafyreigac35izy3dy2qsh6ceqdqecchrzaxc2ccprajr3tmhh75gkvsq7a","auteur_did":"did:plc:fcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/ecologistesenat.bsky.social/post/3m7abd5xjdc2u","date":"2025-12-05T23:18:48.135Z","type":"repost","indexe":"2025-12-05T23:18:48.135Z","text":"Hier soir, lors de l'examen du budget des d'Outre-mer, @mathildeollivier.bsky.social et @aklim.bsky.social ont quitté l'hémicycle et dénoncé l'obstruction de la droite.\n\nQuel mépris pour les Outre-mer ! En minorité dans l'hémicycle, la droite sénatoriale a empêché la démocratie de s'exprimer 😡","facets":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet","features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention","did":"did:plc:aj7nw5dlhpmid2pe3o7jjw2z"}],"index":{"byteEnd":84,"byteStart":55}},{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet","features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention","did":"did:plc:arkelhhutpntqdmqo5jcrzwa"}],"index":{"byteEnd":106,"byteStart":88}}],"author":{"name":"Les Écologistes au Sénat","handle":"ecologistesenat.bsky.social","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/ecologistesenat.bsky.social"},"replyTo":null,"embed":{"video":{"thumb":"https://video.bsky.app/watch/did%3Aplc%3Afcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng/bafkreigmsnowaxorz3ny2z4yshovkquykinwctolwrkugagqipwtye6zua/thumbnail.jpg","alt":""}},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
{"id":"bluesky:rp:did:plc:aj7nw5dlhpmid2pe3o7jjw2z:at://did:plc:fcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng/app.bsky.feed.post/3m7b63isdjs2r","platform":"bluesky","did":"did:plc:aj7nw5dlhpmid2pe3o7jjw2z","uri":"at://did:plc:fcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng/app.bsky.feed.post/3m7b63isdjs2r","cid":"bafyreif7tdrcsvobnmqkmtalbbplkeoodgfo53oymmhmymbanvssprc3mm","auteur_did":"did:plc:fcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/ecologistesenat.bsky.social/post/3m7b63isdjs2r","date":"2025-12-05T23:18:15.931Z","type":"repost","indexe":"2025-12-05T23:18:15.931Z","text":"Budget de l'État 2026 ⤵️\n\nNos principales propositions pour la mission « Enseignement scolaire » avec @moniquedemarco.bsky.social cheffe de file.\n\n👉 Nous défendrons plusieurs amendements pour investir dans l'éducation nationale et donner suite à la commission d'enquête sur Bétharram.","facets":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet","features":[{"$type":"app.bsky.richtext.facet#mention","did":"did:plc:y32ojzipg3dbgvigax3s2zxu"}],"index":{"byteEnd":136,"byteStart":109}}],"author":{"name":"Les Écologistes au Sénat","handle":"ecologistesenat.bsky.social","url":"https://bsky.app/profile/ecologistesenat.bsky.social"},"replyTo":null,"embed":{"images":[{"thumb":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:fcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng/bafkreifa25bcossxsrks4ymmdjeso357ui36iyns6wx2iwuhwfhznyok7u","full":"https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:fcmnegsmqe5eobqbyidqueng/bafkreifa25bcossxsrks4ymmdjeso357ui36iyns6wx2iwuhwfhznyok7u","alt":"","ar":{"height":1450,"width":1080}}]},"labels":[],"collecte_le":"2026-11-20T16:25:24.668Z"},
